coverage.out
/dist/

# Some developers ignore *.md and *.mdc machine-wide via core.excludesFile.
# Documentation is part of this repository, and so is the Cursor rule shipped
# under internal/mcp/assets — it is compiled into the binary by //go:embed, so
# on those machines it would build and test green locally while never reaching
# a commit, and vanish from every clone.
!*.md
!*.mdc

